--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c23573aac6c842542b1665777f9e3822, type: 3}
  m_Name: FatMan
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - speakerName: The Butcher
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3020804b26a692242856c785357a391a, type: 3}
    text: Oh, look who's finally awake. Thought I'd have to bury you in my backyard.
  - speakerName: Ashen
    portrait: {fileID: -1512766464214677766, guid: c3e96d18b70cd404aa460a0fcd1c3ec6, type: 3}
    text: ...Where am I?
  - speakerName: The Butcher
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3020804b26a692242856c785357a391a, type: 3}
    text: In my house, genius. Unless you think I dragged you three miles through
      the forest just to dump you in a ditch.
  - speakerName: Ashen
    portrait: {fileID: -1512766464214677766, guid: c3e96d18b70cd404aa460a0fcd1c3ec6, type: 3}
    text: The forest...? How did I get here?
  - speakerName: The Butcher
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3020804b26a692242856c785357a391a, type: 3}
    text: Found you lying unconscious while I was out hunting. Three days ago. Been
      sleeping like a dead boar ever since.
  - speakerName: Ashen
    portrait: {fileID: -1512766464214677766, guid: c3e96d18b70cd404aa460a0fcd1c3ec6, type: 3}
    text: Three days?! I... I don't remember anything.
  - speakerName: The Butcher
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3020804b26a692242856c785357a391a, type: 3}
    text: Yeah, well, you weren't exactly in a talking mood when I found you.
  - speakerName: Ashen
    portrait: {fileID: -1512766464214677766, guid: c3e96d18b70cd404aa460a0fcd1c3ec6, type: 3}
    text: Who are you? And where is this place?
  - speakerName: The Butcher
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3020804b26a692242856c785357a391a, type: 3}
    text: Name's not important. I'm the butcher around here. And this is Grazlin
      Village.
  - speakerName: Ashen
    portrait: {fileID: -1512766464214677766, guid: c3e96d18b70cd404aa460a0fcd1c3ec6, type: 3}
    text: Grazlin Village... I've never heard of it.
  - speakerName: The Butcher
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3020804b26a692242856c785357a391a, type: 3}
    text: Congratulations. You've discovered a place you've never heard of. Happens
      to people who wander into the woods and nearly get themselves killed.
  - speakerName: The Butcher
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3020804b26a692242856c785357a391a, type: 3}
    text: Hmph. Figures. Listen, stranger. You've been under my roof for three days,
      eating my food and taking up space. You're lucky I'm not charging you for the
      trouble.
  - speakerName: Ashen
    portrait: {fileID: -1512766464214677766, guid: c3e96d18b70cd404aa460a0fcd1c3ec6, type: 3}
    text: Oh... Wait.
  - speakerName: The Butcher
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3020804b26a692242856c785357a391a, type: 3}
    text: What now?
  - speakerName: Ashen
    portrait: {fileID: -1512766464214677766, guid: c3e96d18b70cd404aa460a0fcd1c3ec6, type: 3}
    text: The King! I was supposed to speak to the King!
  - speakerName: The Butcher
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3020804b26a692242856c785357a391a, type: 3}
    text: Oh, wonderful. He's lost his mind.
  - speakerName: Ashen
    portrait: {fileID: -1512766464214677766, guid: c3e96d18b70cd404aa460a0fcd1c3ec6, type: 3}
    text: No, you don't understand! I had something important to tell him. Something
      urgent!
  - speakerName: The Butcher
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3020804b26a692242856c785357a391a, type: 3}
    text: Then go don't bother me anymore
